"""Part 9g-xiv mutations: a soldier's picture dragged and dropped (game/squad_menu.cpp).

Run with the factory build: --build build_factory.bat --check check_campaignscreens.py (FACTORY_TEST;
the "campaignscreens:" checks). Generated (deletions, comparison, number, bool and negation flips; the
lines unique in the file) and by hand (the halves, the copy, the messages, the slots).

134 mutations: all killed but 12, equivalent:
- V 945 num, V 954 num, V 1041 num (-2 for -1: only the sign is read).
- V 942 cmp / num, V 951 cmp / num, V 1042 cmp / num (one more "slot" read past or before the slots: its
  fields match no picture or control id, and OnDrop's search finds a dragged slot's soldier first).
- V 974 del (a failed pick leaves no soldier selected already).
- V 1093 del, V 1094 bool (OnDrop's last showBack: a slot's soldier on the slots' half always returns from
  the swap).
"""
